      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t remember how the coord map works, so I\u0027m struggling to reason about this part of the change. It seems like the behavior is *almost* identical, but not quite. The only difference is if we don\u0027t find the FP in the map, and it returns false for `usesSampleCoords` - previously, that would send us into the else block below, but now we\u0027ll do \"nothing\" through this whole if-else chain? What\u0027s the significance of that arrangement?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 251,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 259,
        "endChar": 72
      },
      "revId": "deedc75f49bbb527abf72445fe19a049e2806ece",
