      "writtenOn": "2023-10-05T14:42:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e but now we\u0027ll do \"nothing\" through this whole if-else chain\n\nRight, if there are no coords, we don\u0027t want a coord parameter in the function signature; doing nothing here is the intent. And we never wanted to alter the coords map here; at this point it\u0027s meant to be fully-baked. I think this was just written this way because `myMap[]` is so much more convenient than `myMap.find`.",
